# What must not reach the build context.
#
# The first two entries are correctness rather than size: a host-built
# `node_modules` copied into a Linux image brings the wrong `@node-rs/argon2`
# binary and a store layout that does not match, and `.env.local` holds the
# database URI and the signing secret. Neither belongs in an image layer.

node_modules
**/node_modules
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Generated by `expo prebuild` and gitignored. Hundreds of megabytes of Android
# project that the server has no use for.
apps/mobile/android
apps/mobile/ios
apps/mobile/.expo
apps/mobile/.expo-export

.git
.github
coverage
tests
docs
scripts/windows
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
